WEBVTT

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.080
"EPISODE 2:
ACQUIRED IMMUNITY"

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.380
"EPISODE 2:
ACQUIRED IMMUNITY"
"Acquired Immunity."

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.000
"EPISODE 2:
ACQUIRED IMMUNITY"

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.120
What's this?

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:54.830
What are all these images I'm seeing?

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:57.170
"WHITE BLOOD CELL"

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:06.210
"CELL"

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:08.500
They're heading this way!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.750
They're flowing...

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:12.750
...right into my mind!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.460
Mump...

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.670
What's wrong with you, Memory Cell?

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:38.880
M-Meteorite shower, people fighting,
a messenger from the outside world...

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.460
What were those images I just saw?

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:45.080
Why would I have such a gorefest of a dream
when I'm not even a Phagocyte?

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:46.500
It shouldn't happen!

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.210
The whole thing felt so abnormal.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.920
Did I envision the moment the world will end?

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:56.250
If that's the case,
then was that a vision of the future?

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.040
And that dream... Could it be...

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.120
Memory?

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:03.750
It's not just that I've committed all past
antigen battles to my memory...

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.080
...I now have the ability
to see the future, too?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.120
Memory!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:15.500
If that's true, then when that virus shows up,
the world will come to an end!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.670
Do you hear me, Memory?

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.620
Enough with the mumbo jumbo!

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:22.330
Just get on with recording
the antigen data, will you?

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:27.380
It all hinges on your body of knowledge
whether or not I can put up a fight, okay?

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:35.080
A viral infection has just been
detected in the parotid gland.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:39.920
All Immune Cells in the area,
please head to the site immediately.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:44.710
Come on, let's go! If it's a known antigen,
we have to mow them down with antibodies!

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.790
Come on, time to get to work!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.710
R-Right.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:51.080
"TOUR ROUTE"
See? It's that thing
hiding in the shadows!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.830
I wonder what that one is. This is so weird.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:07.880
"MUMP"
Mump.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:08.670
Mump.

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:13.250
What is that thing?
That's one strange virus.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.580
Memory, is it in your records?

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.670
Huh? Memory?

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.210
--Get a hold of yourself!
--Memory!

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:22.500
It's not like the world's definitely
going to end just yet!

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:25.750
"ARISE ARISE"
Use your gift of second sight
to find a solution!

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:28.460
Come to me.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.580
Come to me!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.460
Mump!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.210
Wait a sec!

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.670
Huh?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:43.830
Target sighted!

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.420
Mump!

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.210
Die!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.460
Hey, thanks, Neutrophil.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:56.210
Sure. Long time no see,
B Cell and Memory Cell.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.620
Don't leave me behind!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.580
Come to me, premonition!
Come to me! Come to me!

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.330
--What happened to my third eye? Open up!

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.290
--Hey, is something wrong, Memory Cell?
--What happened to my third eye? Open up!

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:10.750
Never mind. We'll deal with all this,
so you guys go on ahead.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.540
Mump!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.120
Mump!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.830
Wha...

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.040
Mump!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.080
Whaaat?

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.290
Oh my! Oh my!

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:37.120
These guys are multiplying like crazy now!

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:45.210
I don't believe it! All that fighting
that I foresaw is really happening now!

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:49.880
Sure, it seems somewhat different
than what I saw with my second sight,

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:54.170
but does this mean
that my gift is the real deal?

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:58.330
Meaning that the fate of this world is--

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.250
Hey, I didn't know you were here, B Cell!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.500
Hurry up and make
some antibodies to save us!

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.420
This virus is no joke!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:10.380
Hold on a second. I can't make antibodies
without any data on the antigens.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.380
I need someone to present the antigen first.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:15.170
Okay then, forget the antibodies!
Just take those guys out!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:20.500
Well, I may be a type of White Blood Cell,
but I don't do phagocytosis.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:22.500
I specialize in attacking with antibodies, so--

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.330
Oh, come on! Figure something out, useless!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.960
Wh-What did you call me?

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:32.710
I'm the only one who can save the world!
Focus! Clear your mind!

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:36.420
A bizarre virus... A battle... Something...

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:40.000
Something's about to come
raining down, I think.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.620
I have no idea! Come on!
My miracle second sight power!

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:48.460
Whoa! What are you doing, Memory? Hey!

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.500
Mump!

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.380
Take this!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.880
Thanks for saving us!

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.250
Will that do?

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:09.000
I'll go present the antigen
to the Commander Helper T Cell, then.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.580
Take care, everyone!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.330
Roger that! We're counting on you!

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:14.670
Counting on you!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:17.830
Once the antigen's presented,
the reinforcements will arrive.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.500
But can we hold out until then?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.960
Come on! Help me look, Memory!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:29.830
We'll make do with a similar-looking virus!
Can't you think of anything?

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:35.000
Don't talk to me, B Cell! The future...
I'm about to get a glimpse of the future!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.210
All this talk about the future
when we're in a crisis...

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:41.420
Never mind the future!
Remember the past, will you?

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:45.580
Hey...

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.210
That's right.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:50.960
It happened all too suddenly.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:52.920
From out of the distant sky,

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.830
way beyond anyone's reach,

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:58.420
a colossal tube appeared.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:03.920
And then, a flood of spheres sealed by powers
from another world came spilling out.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:11.500
Hey, there's something inside!
Inside those capsules!

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.380
What are these things?
They're weak as hell!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:26.290
You're right, totally weak!
Could they be any weaker?

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.580
Mump!

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.250
Such pushovers. I wonder what their deal is.

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.710
Who knows?

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.460
I guess we should stick to protocol

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:38.210
and have someone present the antigen
and preserve the data sample.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.460
Leave it to me.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:43.540
Please record the antigen data,
all right, Memory Cell?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.710
Oh! Will do!

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:54.080
So, that wasn't me seeing the future,

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:54.250
but rather images from the past
that I was seeing?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.710
"MEMORIES"
but rather images from the past
that I was seeing?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.040
Vaccination.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.540
To inject a pathogen or toxin
in a weakened state in advance

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:05.790
in order to acquire immunity from an antigen
as a preventative measure

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:09.250
to develop protection against that disease.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:13.120
The antigenic substance
that is administered is called a "vaccine."

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:16.080
Mump!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.880
Mump!

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:29.920
Mump!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.830
Here they come! They're going
to try to smother us all at once!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:36.290
Mump!

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.000
Wh-What's going on?

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.330
Hey, you guys...

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.880
Thanks for waiting.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.580
The system will now launch.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:02.750
Self-check, okay. Starting injection protocol.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:06.170
Target identified.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.790
Antigen identified. Target, lock on.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.830
Energy charge complete.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:17.420
Eat this, you dirty virus! This is...

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:18.880
"PLEASE TAKE GOOD CARE
OF B CELL"

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.540
"PLEASE TAKE GOOD CARE
OF B CELL"
...the power of acquired immunity!

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.290
"PLEASE TAKE GOOD CARE
OF B CELL"
Acquired immunity.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:30.040
Immunity acquired by infection
or vaccination after birth.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.580
And so, thanks to the power
of acquired immunity,

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:40.290
the antigens soon vanished without a trace.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:43.790
Wow, that only took a second!
And without antigen presentation, too!

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:45.500
Way to go, B Cell!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.120
Good ol' antibodies!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:52.120
Well, he was able to make those antibodies
without the antigen presentation

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:54.330
thanks to my memories, you know.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.830
--What are you talking about? Jeez!
In the first place, it was you who--

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.380
--Oh, hey! Never mind that!
--What are you talking about? Jeez!
In the first place, it was you who--

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.960
There already was an entry on today's virus,
listing it as an antigen,

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.420
but you were going on and on

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:07.250
about some prophecy, and you
just forgot. That was the problem!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.710
What's going on here?

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:11.620
The thing is, this guy
really dropped the ball today!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:14.330
Hey, um, h-hey, hey, B Cell...

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:16.210
Just take a look at this.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.040
Mumps virus.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.420
The virus that causes epidemic parotitis.

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.120
Characterized by swelling

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:26.580
of one or both parotid glands,
causing difficulty in swallowing.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.330
This is why epidemic parotitis

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:34.040
is also known as the "mumps,"
the plural form of "mump" or "grimace."

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.330
I mean, look how thorough your records are!

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:40.670
Shouldn't we feel ridiculous?
After all that toil!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.080
Keep it in your head, for goodness sake!

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:46.040
Forget this ever happened, okay?

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.250
Huh? Should I have kept my mouth shut?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.170
Where's the virus?

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:54.750
What, is it over already?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.790
Man, I'm beat.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.330
"PEYER'S PATCH"

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.170
"PEYER'S PATCH"
"Peyer's Patch."

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.000
"PEYER'S PATCH"

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.830
Here's the next batch!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.460
"SMALL INTESTINE"
Lactose, sucrose, maltose!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.880
Right!

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:15.210
So, this is the small intestine!

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.880
This is where they process
all the nutrients, right?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.580
Hey, what a bustling,
pleasant place this is, huh?

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.250
Thank you so much
for showing us around!

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.080
I have absolutely no clue about this area!

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:28.380
Don't mention it. You're welcome.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:31.040
This is my first time here, too,

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:35.580
but I learned all about the small intestine
during my Erythroblast days.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:38.880
Didn't anyone teach you, too, Senpai?

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.210
I-I know! Why don't I go get us some tea?

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:44.500
I'll only be a minute!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.620
Hey, thank you so much!

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:47.790
"PITTER-PATTER"

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:48.790
"PITTER-PATTER"
Hey, Neutrophil! You sure have the guts.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.670
Hey, Neutrophil! You sure have the guts.

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:56.580
Here we are in the intestines, a single membrane
away from 120 trillion teeming bacteria,

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.330
and you're totally mellowing out.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:03.790
Let me remind you, this isn't a vacation spot
for you nonchalant cells to zone out in!

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:07.880
It's a battleground where we Immune Cells
lock gazes with the germs!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:10.290
Killer T...

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.670
I never knew you Neutrophils
were this complacent.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.380
If you don't get your act together,

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:20.330
you and your friends will end up massacred,
and it'll be "The End" for you.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.170
I'm not going to let that happen.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:27.000
What's that? You've got a problem?
You're the one to blame.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:30.580
I was only showing the new Red Blood Cells
around so they'd have an easier time

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:31.830
doing their jobs.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.120
That's what I mean!
Enough with the handholding!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.080
Killing the enemy is the only thing
that should be on your mind!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.000
H-Hey, hey, both of you...

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:45.250
All I want to know is, will you be able to
respond in an emergency if you're so laid-back?

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.040
What if, even as we speak...

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.330
...there are germs on the...

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.920
...attack.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:58.330
This isn't the colony of bacteria
that resides in the intestines!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:01.790
We're being attacked by every last germ
that multiplied in the nutrients!

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:07.380
This is 1146! Bacteria that multiplied
in the small intestine at D6-18 has landed!

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:12.170
The surrounding tissue is being destroyed!
Requesting immediate backup!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.880
--Killer T...
--Huh?

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.040
We'll pick this up again later.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.500
Give us a hand if it comes to that.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.880
Right.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:25.960
The toxic gas from that bacteria
is endangering the surrounding cells!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:29.250
If we don't stop them,
it'll generate carcinogenic metabolites!

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:31.830
We have to eliminate them right away!

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:36.000
I'd like to see you try it, White Blood Cell.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.250
Of course...

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:41.250
...if you care at all about the life
of this Intestinal Epithelial Cell,

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:45.210
your only option is to do
whatever we Campylobacters say!

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.040
Campylobacter.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:51.080
One of the types of bacteria
that causes infectious enteritis,

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:54.210
triggering fevers, diarrhea, and stomach pain.

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:58.790
Wha... A hostage? That's so low!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.040
Help me!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.380
It's not like we didn't think
long and hard about this.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.960
After all, you murdered
so many of our friends.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:11.120
Because your duty is to protect
the lives of all the normal cells, am I right?

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:15.460
All right, we shouldn't be lounging around
here, or you might catch us off guard.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:18.920
We'll be standing by
inside the intestinal tract.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:22.580
Try and catch us if you can, White Blood Cells!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:23.880
Dammit!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.330
We can't exit this tissue!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.120
Hold up, Campylobacter!

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:30.670
Give us back that hostage!
What are your demands?

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:34.420
We want you to make these intestines
a more comfortable place.

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:37.290
For us Campylobacters, that is.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:43.750
You'll deliver nutrients to us first
and eliminate all germs that get in the way!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:50.710
And you White Blood Cells will perform for us
every day on the other side of that membrane

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:52.580
to keep us entertained.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.710
Yeah, like that!

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:57.920
Also, you'll provide us with
three meals and a nap per day...

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:01.460
...prime real estate in a quiet location
commanding a fine view

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:04.540
where we can build our own colony!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.290
We're going to build a paradise
of Campylobacters

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:10.960
by Campylobacters and for Campylobacters!

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:14.250
After which, for the sake of maintaining order
in perpetuity and for all eternity...

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:15.460
All right, fine.

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.500
We'll accept your terms.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:18.540
"MURMUR"
We'll accept your terms.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:22.460
Once we've done that--
What? No way! You accept?

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.460
"IN TRAINING"
Yippee!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.420
"IN TRAINING"
What the...

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.080
What the...

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:32.170
All right! In that case, we'll release
the hostage, but first, do as I say!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.540
Think about what you've done!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:37.330
You bastards slaughtered scores of our friends!
Dance some kind of jig!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.380
We have no choice! Dance!

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:42.210
Now pulverize each other!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.580
Wh-What the cell is that moron doing?

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:50.790
I always knew he was a moron,
but who would've known he was this stupid?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:54.500
W-We did as you asked.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:59.170
All right, then, let the hostage go!

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.000
Now that you're in such a weakened state,

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:05.620
you probably couldn't catch me
if I invaded the tissue.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.210
What? Don't tell me you're...

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.580
It'd be too pathetic if you died
because you turned on each other.

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.420
Why don't I just finish you off myself?

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:16.210
Wait, Campylobacter! That's not what
we agreed on! Let the hostage--

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:19.250
What do I care? Die!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.420
You utter fool!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:27.790
He was never going to release the hostage!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:29.710
How can you not see that?

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.500
Squad Leader...

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.080
Just look at you!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:41.460
You really underestimated the power of a germ!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.830
Bye now!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:48.670
Come back here! You're not heading that way!

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.380
Jeez, the germ just took off with the hostage!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.580
Damn, I can't even watch this.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.960
You stupid nonchalant cell...

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.120
Talk about pesky!

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.540
You still have enough strength left
to chase after me?

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.210
Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.290
Are you okay...

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.500
...No. 1146?

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:15.500
This is bad! Look at us! We're so close
to that spot that's super-easy to infiltrate!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:19.040
There's no villi there, so it's like
an easy access entrance for bacteria!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:22.040
You idiot! Keep your voice down
about that stuff!

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.460
Hey! That is...

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.000
Shush! We can't let them find out!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.250
My bad!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.170
They're in an uproar about something.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.540
Hey, do you know
what they're talking about?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.500
W-Well, that would be... um...

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.120
Well, if I told you...

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.750
...would you at least spare my life?

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:38.580
Sure, I can do that.

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.620
--Hey, don't do it, Intestinal Epithelial Cell!
--You see, up ahead, there's a spot
where both villi and membranes are sparse.

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:43.540
--Anything but that! Just don't
breathe a word about that to him!
--You see, up ahead, there's a spot
where both villi and membranes are sparse.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:45.500
And if I may say so myself,
it's about as airtight as a sieve.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.620
So, I imagine it would be easily
infiltrated by you bacteria.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.580
"TEARY EYES"
So, I imagine it would be easily
infiltrated by you bacteria.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.880
By any chance, would you be talking about...

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.880
...this place right here?

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:58.380
Uh-oh! We're doomed! He found it!

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.250
Um, what should I do now?

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:02.460
Shut up! I have no more use for you!

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:05.880
Yippee! Follow me, you guys!
We've invaded the tissues!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:09.170
From here on in, we'll have unlimited food
and a warm place to sleep!

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:13.330
And we'll never have to worry about
earning our keep again!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:17.670
Woo-hoo! Nutrients!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:20.120
Lucky us! Look how much there is!

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:23.670
Let's start gorging ourselves
and dividing like crazy!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.790
Welcome.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:34.790
What'll it be for you, sir?

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:42.040
What do you mean, what'll it be?
I'm a bacterium! I want all of the food here!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.540
Ah, you don't say.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.670
Please, partake.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:51.710
After all, this is more or less your Last
Supper. Please enjoy yourselves to the fullest.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:57.170
What are you talking about? Oh, never mind!
I'm just going to grab whatever-- Wha...

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.670
We thought you'd never
get here, Campylobacter.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:04.040
An Immune Cell?
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.500
Wh-What good will it do
to take us on alone?

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.710
It's punishment time.

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:15.210
To think that you couldn't see
through all that blatant baiting...

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.960
Stooping to dirty tactics
like taking a hostage...

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.670
Don't underestimate us Neutrophils!

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:24.540
This is an immune tissue
in the small intestine

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:27.920
where we lure stupid germs like you
so we can kill you in one fell swoop!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.380
A Peyer's Patch!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:30.790
Peyer's Patch.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.710
A mass of immune tissue that
can be found in the depressions

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:38.210
between the villi in the small intestine
or in areas where there are no villi.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:42.330
They are filled with lymphatic nodules.

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:46.710
These patches play a crucial role
in the intestinal immune system.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:56.460
And I'm M Cell, the proprietor
of this Peyer's Patch.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.960
M Cell.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:04.120
A cell found on the surface of the Peyer's Patch
which traps bacterial and viral antigens.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:07.830
The captured bacteria and viruses
are handed off to the Dendritic Cells

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:09.830
and presented as antigens.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:16.790
You never caught on, but we sent
a signal when you knocked us back

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:20.040
that we were going to lure you
to the Peyer's Patch.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.620
S-Signal?

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:22.920
That's right!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.120
That was...

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:26.960
...the "M" for "M Cell"!

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:29.500
That's not fair!

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:33.330
Shut up! Like fair has anything to do with it!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:37.210
"CERTIFICATE OF APPRECIATION"

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:38.580
"CERTIFICATE OF APPRECIATION"
Hey, that sure worked out!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:40.170
Hey, that sure worked out!

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:42.790
Good job, getting him to fall for your trap!

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:47.250
I know I kept calling you a moron...

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:52.420
...but you do have a good head on your shoulders
sometimes. I had the wrong idea about you.

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:53.670
Killer T...

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:57.580
But from now on,
try not to mellow out too much.

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:01.710
Try not to mellow out too much.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:04.040
I seem to have forgotten something.

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.580
That White Blood Cell's taking forever, huh?

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:11.380
Just how long are we going to wait?

00:22:11.380 --> 00:22:13.710
I wonder if he got lost.

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:15.170
Uh-oh!

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:18.830
I totally forgot to get
the Red Blood Cells their tea!

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:21.040
Okay, so he is a moron after all.

